    "diagnosis": "Follicular adenoma, signet-ring cell type",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Some follicular adenomas will show cytoplasmic clearing, which creates a signet-ring appearance. However, the neoplastic cells are still immunoreactive for thyroid transcription factor&nbsp;1 (TTF1), thyroglobulin, and PAX8 (not shown).",
